⚠️ Current Known Issues / Active Work
Time Model Problems (HIGH PRIORITY)
1. Calendar-day assumption (broken)
Current behavior:
Day = 00:00 → 23:59 ❌
Problem:
    • Breaks night shifts
    • Breaks after-work sleep
    • Creates unrealistic placement constraints

2. User Day Boundary (partially implemented)
We already have:
schedulingPreferences.dayBoundaryStartTime
But:
    • Not exposed in UI
    • Not used in visualizer
    • Not fully respected in placement

3. Night shift placement issue
Example failure:
Shift: 21:45 → 06:15
Sleep after work → blocked ❌
Cause:
System thinks day ended at 23:59

4. Shift setup friction
    • User must manually decide crossesMidnight
    • Should be automatic

5. Template self-reference risk
Potential invalid behavior:
Sleep before Sleep ❌
Sleep after Sleep ❌
Needs prevention logic

6. Sleep recurrence incomplete
Current:
Sleep not guaranteed all 7 days ❌
Should be:
Sleep = every day ✔

